-- =============================================================================
-- Poli Valko — Idempotent Production SEO Metadata & Content Hygiene Apply Script
-- =============================================================================
-- Target schema: EF Core 11 / PostgreSQL 18 (PoliValkoDbContext)
--   - catalog.categories         (slug, seo_title, seo_description, description)
--   - content.service_directions (code, description, seo_title, seo_description, updated_at)
--   - content.pages              (slug, seo_title, seo_description, updated_at, updated_by)
--   - content.contacts           (id, facebook, updated_at)
--   - content.banners            (image_url, updated_at)
--   - catalog.products           (brand, updated_at)
--   - catalog.brands             (id, name, normalized_name, slug, description, logo_url)
--
-- Coverage:
--   * 89 catalog categories (seo_title & seo_description)
--   * 13 priority catalog categories (8 L1 + 5 L2 plain-text 'Як обрати' guides <= 2000 chars)
--   *  7 service directions (Kyiv Oblast geo-expanded description, seo_title, seo_description)
--   *  4 CMS legal/info pages (payment-delivery, returns, offer, privacy)
--   *  1 contacts hygiene check (remove generic root-only https://www.facebook.com placeholder)
--   *  3 seeded banner hygiene replacements (replace legacy images.unsplash.com URLs with /brand/*)
--   *  1 duplicate brand normalization (Bross / Bros -> BROS across products & brands)
--
-- Safety:
--   * Wrapped in a single transaction (BEGIN ... COMMIT).
--   * 100% idempotent (IS DISTINCT FROM guards; re-running applies 0 changes).
--   * Dry-run preview & rollback instructions: deploy/scripts/README-seo-apply.md
-- =============================================================================

BEGIN;

